  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da9f6902cd87396e3fe471cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是Maya！\r\n我会为你响起抵达终点的钟声的☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9469a3f1d1044c6f039797cb09eb6372572c412376e347ff6e4b34fddadbce03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c343697826d6e772abd341a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "利用肉球，High jump！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0730853eb55c6e852f55a7a0e8354ffe9035af184853b51774742e06099cdaa2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb12d8af313c7099eacdee64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喵喵突进~☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9629bad070240054e75e78032cb6b996f221d78deaf8a3856463181bc920b508",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9d7d4d10957aaf16cb49533",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Maya喵……要夜航喽~！\r\n欸嘿，你能抓到我吗喵~？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eb8935330b9a0eed9a129c88830f7f3df98f227fcec4c691590740c4d21ef9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:855b235ff5f440d00d950e96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是Maya！\r\n一起来欢欣雀跃吧喵♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "53759661034e22c43f8c4ee7acf58176859a15cdd4bd6a1511ca7658ca0c9ad1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bd573937327a180b2492807",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "配合起来的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b88c2a1ac706fc297b6eef01077f57b77ad3dd9b42367a8a4f400413383ccd80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:922d356b05ff82d21eae5f67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您的话语……总能让人心灵平静……\n只有您才能带给我这样的感受……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7cbf20864dd5f9528de253216761653e6c5f5cc1c602cdccdd0e7294255e6cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14288e2ca445fd01d0464130",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "793275eb5254d9ee0aa95daa33c90a973bec2e4a987e75c094e5b5d339927bef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01f347942dcec696d9f4adb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま戻りました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6187171daf0cd83405ed28676a1e5578db71985c3568e13f3c699b7bfbf84546",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aecd6e3f55c2dad183401cdb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我所能看见的东西……\n和您所感觉到的东西……\n就算它们完全不同……",
      "source_fingerprint": "faa118e0cfecb0520c361b2b492adaf473de0023225e3a8f48a8f95185ea6e59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:334a51c667c1e86f53a4ef92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…您似乎是很容易被『它们』亲近的体质……\n如果周围发生什么奇怪的事情……\n请立刻告诉我……",
      "source_fingerprint": "38db3d3850b3e2e0f2583ed2dff362ace5bf369ed76f884de402928e0db81ea8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6d3c866eb8e2f567b7e0a48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新的一年也即将到来……\n我会沉眠大地之中，还是化作灿烂的鲜花呢……\n我的命运，全部交予您的手中——",
      "source_fingerprint": "111f609ba5cc34cb6c9c9bb5edbeead58b5e5768b0825cd46836794990b64819",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c9d906b8b97852ceb6cd4be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "信念的力量、比任何东西都要强大……\n过去那些伟人的夙愿，若是能超越时间，\n被现在的人们继承的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "53e10eae6ce2f225c28d703aec73288465a4d88defb936dd7aac01873ad7552c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:234a39944a65c5e4fd9af7a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要在巧克力中注入怎样的感情，是我的自由……\n而要怎样接受这份感情，是您的自由……\n请拿好，巧克力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5e5643f56b0cf9c532e3102e71992b896553835312dc7f4ddc03a796bd6c926",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8911ac121c70b8d5ac1d6c64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竹影斑驳……繁星闪烁……\n这一年仅能许下一次的愿望……\n请千万要实现……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9613ada24575b725b9ddf1a6daaea9b3226a1d1a3f7de3cf8d5ceab79a69aa4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afa3d0ff32f35ab8a9d56961",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "彼世与我们的距离，正在逐渐缩短……\n呵呵，比平时能听见更多它们的声音……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8590a8a4b9170e49d08cb855507dd37f544654d259f9cd309cacc47f573d33a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b78d2478b7b3a2fe50209273",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是充满了不可思议的感觉呢……\n不管看见什么在天上飞都不会觉得奇怪了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "80d5cfebaf4730f94c0baf17067b2c190ecee5b2c7b9cbbc8b8a34a821dcfbea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc94851436e50670e956028e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是特意为今天准备的咖啡……\n就如玛瑙那般，鲜艳而美丽……\n您愿意的话……要一起来喝吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2581415ce5fcc3524fc155819de48f0fceec19bb0f70e4906d12890cd1af84a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f99ab5f9d6959d6d6444de7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赢了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a3a6d85f38d701106bce5b03255ac4ab87c03e52e86942163b0c66ae1fac555",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33503aa2753b3b120bcb13dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果每个月……都收集一份美丽的东西的话，\n那么最后就能收获满满一打的回忆……\n这就是属于我的，小小的宝箱……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8789edc2f102ef79df25131c80153ca21c90f395dbe7d68a10eb1a48212cce7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1203a0282ff36dc8f1cdc6f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……祝您生日快乐。\n瓶中花的标本、和热土所制的杯子……\n您想要哪个？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed1d70038701b908077f071f01d66e5d4243ee635a84e0241536b994884ae68d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5d6ca4ce7e26a0d8456658c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为您的诞生之日献上我的祝福……\n然后，为您的温柔……\n献上我的敬意与感谢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2fb45058ac03e6b0a7a87c1d1a4e2efc5d1678aa9140fd505127c461c5d9b7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bb58e6c8c08366fa516ecf5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我的……生日呢……\n希望今年，紧随我身后的影子，\n不会继续变大——",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e53c4703f79a43dcb0db8ab2d48b3576a138429c1ce39701a6e774921eb2b93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:758fdc21cb9575b169b4a243",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“想要什么礼物……？”\n……您觉得好的就行。\n因为……我想更加了解您的想法……",
      "source_fingerprint": "782716d4d5f9df7815ca16b36ac58539fb98018c36c9cf66d6b484c1233dae3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb6487c56253af47f8083d2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有新的通知。\n您听，有声音正在呼唤着您……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6cb92c346b3975aebba97ce7ee9393bb636b666a151377905aa0672d80642d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b360b2d5096fd605ad2217f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有礼物呢……\n……刚刚，礼物盒是不是动了……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "baedf18d44d66079bec5ecf61307903c1b0093a38675b833961e3b23e2c1ab8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:307a39a6d8acf43770b81681",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成了呢。\n……呵呵，大家也很开心的样子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5ab128407128317c801c6287e8d0bc74e378cd39b3fb0636d13544d6a4e6975",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:808b03687fc80e7d9ae531a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动马上要开始了……\n不管发生什么都好，做足准备吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3c8065e5d94a355a0fd75332f4266fadb56964a7a0ed563a619f1297e3bc52e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de17a810e5687840ff235379",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动好像开始了呢……\n要去冒险的话，\n可千万不能忘了提灯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "120efd069587800d63953e415ff163373415ca83c4bf6b4011b0ef97f0673d46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e182c0447f7c62f71493d587",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "遗憾……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b90d4c62e74958085df917f698ab583a79d74bee83b9ff2b37beab23e083308",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f850c49a2adc2da0f850d05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级提升了呢。\n不知不觉间……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ede08cc0e2734123cb9e090ba2282c6a7f92eb5cb7824db2fdd0db9a8a3f7f96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d52241d12653ddd434dbb6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "優しいカフェラテの色に、澄んだ\r\nエスプレッソの黒…私服のコーデも\r\n不思議と好きな色になりますね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b1ab4ad85ec31a9549382c003b90644928079ae9e2f20167362f604d23179ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db81fedfc180a4db0694a085",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "猫カフェに行くと、みんながこの\r\nベルトにじゃれついてくれて…ふふ\r\n猫の足跡マークのおかげでしょうか",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c4568e74a20a16e32e58ab547b59a006d18246ce39c65a7bceb309c9d154ef8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19c09cf17ed5e6a150e73ba6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朧月の色をした水族館のクラゲ…\r\n熱帯の夜に咲く温室の蘭…なぜか\r\n惹かれて…何度も観に行きます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bcb3df68e48dfb03df12a421691ab0c10334b4e96feb245b5e1d000b0bc63de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:219645e8cc3f5a3ba1a02140",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平局……",
      "source_fingerprint": "457cc7b18c4137278bc3cdcbbf35eb2a74451224c347181bfffda80becd723af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eab1f9e94defb727ab56b00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我们的胜利呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a30b054f212712702078c940e5f32a88d3cda72e7a2cbf09828fe09f46a67fdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d54a87000fcd3abc5dbb644d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "遗憾……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b90d4c62e74958085df917f698ab583a79d74bee83b9ff2b37beab23e083308",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92fac90c1cbf45cdc70c75c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平局……",
      "source_fingerprint": "457cc7b18c4137278bc3cdcbbf35eb2a74451224c347181bfffda80becd723af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d9491f5d7bb887cd260878b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高分更新了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9d5f9490f10f63b3ecbd6fdbffd6d6d2a5198bd8372fa51c17aa5b8c9be1c14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc6eb7e7770f7fcf06a66534",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标只有一个……",
      "source_fingerprint": "37db6500b95067611df086635f23712287eca99759a0001233ef6d7bdec7487f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbac22ff81638b4193dcad70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "禁止实验……",
      "source_fingerprint": "78f37708838ff64b063fba2577e0d84935d4fadc31499d71455d5f97b676fc5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "1057"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ee336bc39d73cab6f09cca2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别被迷惑……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d925be123f43e7bf88ebfc4d0eb9efeb9fc68d218aa0130ce7433eb26ee6cf5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "1058"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1b2b7c0438fffc8b65e35ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6de19aa6fb302a723657c53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……要去追追看那道影子吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ceb6a432a5d80c99f51ca0b95a8748265d230cb0bef8f2156b524bf16bcaa95f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:597ee95f63db76768b6dd92c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们的故事也化作了历史……\n但历史也会继续向前……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bd839b0b464e8007683ea1ceba316d24f9f0455b76eb86b9dfa89c30076ca74",
