      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dc35216c60085b102886a8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbe9b8a6562528c71dac2f35e4bb3503757fd80fd15a323c0f3842922f08e2da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a83370540d838095c78a171e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天的奖励好像是这个……",
      "source_fingerprint": "eab8ef4918f53a4323fe49312061f2e15629a8a438aec4e2d71714c348340db5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8e123d720c062dade9d1294",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仿佛……\n要被影子吞噬了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "67b754ea4085844afba914fa2bd14c64880a73ec4101ebfa69510c20dab45dc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50a15a44a6c642485bd06447",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请给我……\n喝一杯咖啡的时间……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0901086e788218f0ec1cbf861ae7f10176d40a78961a0f43951743b22f00ab56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf82fe35f05bb92bb18db8ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的话……\n说不定甚至能抓住天上的群星……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48b8b88f1f0e476c891892392c14a68b1e114859becafc1cd6b699c2eb9d64bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a62140a504949f6245dcf544",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "龙有双翼，\n而我有咖啡……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ed5d6e254ae5da8e7f93fc123ffa9ab3b396f65f7f1e53aa4eaae4f97841037",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d0b8c1eff846f012eee225c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的话……\n感觉能一跃便攀上山顶……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "47cfd9afbbaea6e646082f4065f25251981473e56f08f35cc4aab037087c5e2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fabfd9b360fdafb7755ae919",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "灵魂、正在熊熊燃烧……\n如送神火一般明亮……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7da7b3581b4fe3ff74f23daba486114ed273f65fcac5df286ecdad84f5bf9e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eaf476bc1713734c1605ce0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做什么好呢……\n干脆，去找找会说人话的猫吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0107b85df30682f1b339c5d70ddef6eb34b3c2db5ea85d9b64daa6f1f63dd3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68e2d7558daac3bf18f97f9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……开始吧。\n朋友……也这么说哦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d7a11ba4974c15e95bebf1158f49dfc5087bd6e943f54389229e3f81ebebb38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a3b8ddddeaa45058656dcca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来……\n不能太勉强呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9183a09219a8e5f3ce9d77f109ea0fed0c09e7d6b4090cf61f49e3703225d67f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87579398ff5f7dffa74f2091",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有咖啡的话……\n白开水也不错……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e17180b7bcd3f3442773ff24c590333a46685c40d36d2fa125e394547fbdddd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17bb7cbffc1eec7611dfe7f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说不定，我们经历的一切……\n不过是蝴蝶的梦境……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fa614bf4ba205bdf6487c1812854875e2fdb340a98ee0e65510f5f4e3ee1d5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
